WEBVTT

00:01:57.267 --> 00:02:00.806
and I'll hunt fish and skin them
alive and eat them,

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:05.577
and maybe drag a desalinization plant
behind me for fresh water.

00:02:05.601 --> 00:02:10.307
(Laughter)

00:02:10.331 --> 00:02:11.588
Yes, I have a team.

00:02:11.612 --> 00:02:14.115
(Laughter)

00:02:14.139 --> 00:02:16.418
And the team is expert,

00:02:16.442 --> 00:02:18.590
and the team is courageous,

00:02:18.614 --> 00:02:22.776
and brimming with innovation
and scientific discovery,

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:26.887
as is true of any major
expedition on the planet.

00:02:28.035 --> 00:02:30.134
And we've been on a journey.